{
  "name": "Lab L048 — RAG Lacombe : ingestion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 1 — Ingestion (tutoriel A, section 1.2)\nLit `documents/*.md` (monté sur `/home/node/lab-files/lacombe`), découpe **1 000 / 150**, vectorise avec\n**Ollama nomic-embed-text** et range dans le *Simple Vector Store* `lacombe-procedures`.\n⚠️ Le Simple Vector Store vit en mémoire : **tout disparaît au redémarrage** de n8n. Relancez ce workflow après chaque redémarrage\n(l'option *Clear Store* vide la base avant chaque ingestion : pas de doublons).\nModèle d'embeddings : **nomic-embed-text** — le même doit être branché sur la consultation.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "a75462fd-2353-5f79-b7d6-eeb1e7b8668f",
      "name": "Note — ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f6b32b93-7a4e-5d78-bd51-298905a38c6a",
      "name": "Lancer l'ingestion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fileSelector": "/home/node/lab-files/lacombe/*.md",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f69ea2d6-fe78-5955-949c-f4c70f76908b",
      "name": "Lire les documents",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "memoryKey": "lacombe-procedures",
        "clearStore": true
      },
      "id": "781cafae-9fe5-5776-ab29-40d86935b95c",
      "name": "Simple Vector Store — insérer",
